      },
      "text": "The Argentine Side of Iguazú Falls"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bec3c9b937c727055ce4c6752ac0aa506cfc2284501846d00651f29b2d497344",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-0c9cd3aa-38d8-4e78-85c2-7fba7217988e",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, visit Iguazú National Park.\n\nThe falls consist of 275 separate cascades. The most powerful is Garganta del Diablo, or Devil’s Throat, which drops 72 metres.\n\nThe tour includes the ecological train, the viewpoints and the Upper and Lower Circuits.\n\n**Great Iguazú Adventure: Zodiac Boat and Jungle**\n\nOptional\n\nDuration: 1 hour 15 minutes."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:0b4af8d3ee5a70df",
      "field": "itinerary.label",
      "sourceTextSha256": "df887b79e5746f6aba25efaa6972c571e6f21b4822e27ddd898b0b461b3b2244",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-0c9cd3aa-38d8-4e78-85c2-7fba7217988e",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Puerto Iguazú"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:dab30c58171353c7",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "00ad24b89f7b0d9df661cb18093bc92953a0448199c3da935eb2ca0d654823f4",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-0c9cd3aa-38d8-4e78-85c2-7fba7217988e",
